"""The folder tree of the API documentation: where each endpoint lives, and what each folder is for.

A new endpoint goes in the folder whose rule matches its path (RULES, first match wins). Set its tag in
brainixa_api_openapi.json to that folder name. A new folder needs a line in FOLDERS too - the
collection builder refuses a folder with no description.
"""
